  "description": "Dear Team,\n\nFor the upcoming fMRIPrep run we have prepared the following inputs and configuration. The required API key is **ABCD1234EFGH5678**, and the FreeSurfer license string is **XXXX\u2011XXXX\u2011XXXX\u2011XXXX**. Both the T1\u2011weighted and T2\u2011weighted anatomical images are supplied as NIfTI files.  \n\nThe processing will be carried out with outputs saved, and intermediate files will be written to the folder **sub-01/func**. We are not using longitudinal mode, and the BOLD\u2011to\u2011T1w registration will use nine degrees of freedom. The intermediate files will retain the default name **ref_image_corrected_brain.nii.gz**. FreeSurfer processing is enabled, and no specific data types are being ignored (the ignore setting is left empty). We will not keep additional intermediate work, and the template space is set to **MNI152NLin2009cAsym**. Medial\u2011surface NaNs are not permitted, and boundary\u2011based registration is not forced nor explicitly disabled. The final output space will be **template fsaverage5**, with resampling performed in the native grid. Finally, neither force\u2011no\u2011BBR nor T2*\u2011to\u2011T1w coregistration are activated.\n\nPlease let me know if any adjustments are needed before we launch the pipeline."
